                        "review": "short, sweet and fun! music's dope, 3 (technically 4) game modes and a NG+. Held back some by way of certain items/upgrades not functioning correctly on bosses, repetitive waves, and some items being just poopy. Game is good for one or two streams cause twitch integrations.\n\nReminds me of the old flash games of yore. not bad for 8 bucks, seen worse for less tbh.",
